  "paragraphs": [
    "LISTENING EARS. COMPASSIONATE HEARTS. GIFTED HANDS. DEDICATED TO SERVING YOUR COMMUNITY.",
    "BETTER DENTISTRY. BETTER EXPERIENCE. BETTER RESULTS. COMMITTED TO DELIVERING STATE-OF-THE-ART CARE.",
    "OVER 70 CONVENIENT LOCATIONS THROUGHOUT NORTH CAROLINA, SOUTH CAROLINA AND VIRGINIA. COMMUNITY FOCUSED, HOMETOWN FEEL.",
